WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:00.953
- [Voiceover] This great, big story

00:00:00.953 --> 00:00:03.190
was made possible by Wells Fargo.

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:06.563
Established 1852, re-established 2018.

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:10.550
- [Voiceover] Every night during
the holy month Of Ramadan,

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:13.290
Muslims around the world attend an iftar-

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:15.653
a meal to break the day's religious fast.

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:18.950
But in Iran's holy city of Mashhad,

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:21.008
there is an iftar like no other.

00:00:21.008 --> 00:00:26.008
- [Voiceover] (speaking
in foreign language)

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:32.430
- During the 30 days of Ramadan,

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:37.010
the Imam Reza mosque hosts a
break fast of epic proportions.

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:38.880
Every night as the sun sets,

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:42.658
thousands of meals are
served to hungry observers.

00:00:42.658 --> 00:00:47.658
- [Voiceover] (speaking
in foreign language)

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:50.250
- [Voiceover] Cooking for that many people

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:51.414
can be a daunting job,

00:00:51.414 --> 00:00:55.000
so they enlist the help
of over 400 volunteers.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:59.083
- (speaking in foreign language)

00:01:13.510 --> 00:01:14.370
- [Voiceover] To pull this off,

00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:17.070
the volunteer chefs start
their day at five a.m.

00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:19.000
and spend most of their time chopping

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:20.600
and stirring the evening's meal.

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:25.550
But 13,000 meals means a lot of food.

00:01:25.550 --> 00:01:28.630
The mosque goes through 2
tons of fresh vegetables,

00:01:28.630 --> 00:01:29.940
4 tons of rice,

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:33.143
and 3 tons of meat every single night.

00:01:38.829 --> 00:01:43.829
- [Voiceover] (speaking
in foreign language)

00:01:49.630 --> 00:01:51.050
- [Voiceover] But despite the challenges,

00:01:51.050 --> 00:01:54.010
volunteers and patrons alike
consider it a great honor

00:01:54.010 --> 00:01:56.283
to attend this special iftar.

00:01:56.283 --> 00:02:01.283
- [Voiceover] (speaking
in foreign language)

00:02:14.423 --> 00:02:17.006
(soft dinging)

